    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet phmr-observation-vs</b></p><a name=\"phmr-observation-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcphmr-observation-vs\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html\"><code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.1</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;10.0.2</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html#1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829-NPU03804\">NPU03804</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Pt—Legeme; masse = ? kg</td><td>Pt—Legeme; masse = ? kg</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html#1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829-NPU19748\">NPU19748</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">P—C-reaktivt protein; massek. = ? mg/L</td><td>P—C-reaktivt protein; massek. = ? mg/L</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html#1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829-NPU22089\">NPU22089</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">P(kB)—Glucose; stofk. = ? mmol/L</td><td>P(kB)—Glucose; stofk. = ? mmol/L</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html#1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829-NPU03963\">NPU03963</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">U—Erythrocytter; arb.k.(proc.) = ?</td><td>U—Erythrocytter; arb.k.(proc.) = ?</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html#1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829-DNK05472\">DNK05472</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Blodtryk systolisk;Arm</td><td>Arm—Blodtryk(systolisk); tryk = ? mmHg</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html#1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829-DNK05473\">DNK05473</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Blodtryk diastolisk;Arm</td><td